slurm-docker-cluster
  https://github.com/giovtorres/slurm-docker-cluster
  Copyright (c) 2024 Giovanni Torres. MIT License.
  Adapted: the Dockerfile build steps, docker-entrypoint.sh, the compose layout, and
  slurmdbd.conf, cgroup.conf and slurm.conf (through the SPANK plugin demo of
  spank-plugins).

Slurm Workload Manager (slurm-25-11-6-1)
  https://github.com/SchedMD/slurm
  GNU General Public License v2.0 or later, with an exception for linking with OpenSSL.
  Built from the tag above; the source is available at that URL and tag.

QRMI SPANK plugin (spank-plugins, commit c3d5679e688ad77146a15335fc2ab466429a2895)
  https://github.com/qiskit-community/spank-plugins
  Copyright IBM, Pasqal 2025, 2026. GNU General Public License v3.0.
  The image contains the compiled plugin at /usr/lib64/slurm/spank_qrmi.so and the
  complete corresponding source at /usr/src/spank-plugins.

QRMI (commit 3deb5124c448b73f1a44c083d18517c42df7e23a)
  https://github.com/qiskit-community/qrmi
  Copyright 2025 IBM and its contributors. Apache License 2.0.
  Linked statically (libqrmi.a) into spank_qrmi.so.

OpenMPI 4.1.8
  https://www.open-mpi.org/
  3-clause BSD license (see /opt/openmpi/share/doc/openmpi or the OpenMPI LICENSE file).

OpenPMIx 4.1.3
  https://github.com/openpmix/openpmix
  3-clause BSD license.

gosu 1.17
  https://github.com/tianon/gosu
  Apache License 2.0.

Rocky Linux 9 base image and packages
  https://rockylinux.org/
  Each package under its own license (see /usr/share/licenses in the image).

MariaDB 10.11 (the separate mariadb:10.11 image that compose.yml runs)
  https://mariadb.org/
  GNU General Public License v2.0.

The default image (target qcsc) also contains, in /home/qcsc and /opt:

qcsc-prefect (the ref in the image label io.qcsc.qcsc-prefect.ref)
  https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect
  Apache License 2.0. A git checkout at /home/qcsc/qcsc-prefect.

Fulqrum (the commit that qcsc-prefect's build_fulqrum.sh pins)
  https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fulqrum
  Apache License 2.0. Built from source, with its source at
  /home/qcsc/qcsc-prefect/packages/qcsc-prefect-fulqrum/native/external/fulqrum.

PRIMME
  https://github.com/primme/primme
  3-clause BSD license. Built from the PyPI sdist into the Fulqrum environment.

ffsim
  https://github.com/qiskit-community/ffsim
  Apache License 2.0. On arm64, built from the PyPI sdist.

uv
  https://github.com/astral-sh/uv
  MIT License or Apache License 2.0. In /home/qcsc/.local/bin.

JupyterLab
  https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab
  3-clause BSD license. In /opt/jupyter.

Python packages from PyPI in the environments under /home/qcsc/venv, /opt/jupyter and
the Fulqrum environment, including Prefect (Apache 2.0), Qiskit (Apache 2.0), QRMI
(Apache 2.0) and PySCF (Apache 2.0). Each keeps its own license, in the dist-info
directory of the package; ~/venv/*.freeze.txt lists them.

The Rust toolchains used to build QRMI and ffsim run in build stages only and are not
part of the image.
